      <description><![CDATA[
<h2>What's new in 0.1.18</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Bank details for vendors and contractors.</b> The Companies list shows whose bank details we have. A vendor's or a contractor's page shows their 1Password and Revolut records under In other apps, with Ask for details and Link a 1Password record (Owner and Admins).</li>
<li><b>Fixed:</b> on a contact's page, an email from a long sender address no longer pushes the page over the contacts list.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
